---
// FAQ Section Component
---

<section id="faq" class="section bg-white">
  <div class="container-wrapper">
    <div class="section-title">
      <h2>Frequently Asked Questions</h2>
      <p>Find answers to common questions about our services</p>
    </div>

    <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto space-y-4">
      <!-- FAQ Item 1 -->
      <div class="border border-gray-200 rounded-lg overflow-hidden">
        <button class="faq-toggle w-full flex items-center justify-between px-6 py-4 hover:bg-gray-50 transition-colors text-left font-medium text-gray-900">
          <span>What technologies do you work with?</span>
          <svg class="faq-icon w-5 h-5 text-gray-600 transition-transform" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
            <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M19 14l-7 7m0 0l-7-7m7 7V3"></path>
          </svg>
        </button>
        <div class="faq-content hidden px-6 pb-4 text-gray-600 border-t border-gray-200">
          <p>We work with modern, proven technologies including React, Next.js, Vue, Node.js, Python, TypeScript, React Native, Flutter, and more. We choose the best stack for your specific needs and project goals.</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- FAQ Item 2 -->
      <div class="border border-gray-200 rounded-lg overflow-hidden">
        <button class="faq-toggle w-full flex items-center justify-between px-6 py-4 hover:bg-gray-50 transition-colors text-left font-medium text-gray-900">
          <span>What's the typical project timeline?</span>
          <svg class="faq-icon w-5 h-5 text-gray-600 transition-transform" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
            <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M19 14l-7 7m0 0l-7-7m7 7V3"></path>
          </svg>
        </button>
        <div class="faq-content hidden px-6 pb-4 text-gray-600 border-t border-gray-200">
          <p>Most MVPs take 2-4 weeks, while larger projects scale from there. We'll provide a detailed timeline during the discovery phase based on scope, complexity, and your team's capacity. We prioritize transparency and predictability.</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- FAQ Item 3 -->
      <div class="border border-gray-200 rounded-lg overflow-hidden">
        <button class="faq-toggle w-full flex items-center justify-between px-6 py-4 hover:bg-gray-50 transition-colors text-left font-medium text-gray-900">
          <span>Do you provide ongoing support after launch?</span>
          <svg class="faq-icon w-5 h-5 text-gray-600 transition-transform" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
            <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M19 14l-7 7m0 0l-7-7m7 7V3"></path>
          </svg>
        </button>
        <div class="faq-content hidden px-6 pb-4 text-gray-600 border-t border-gray-200">
          <p>Absolutely! We believe in long-term partnerships. We offer various support packages including bug fixes, feature enhancements, performance optimization, and dedicated support hours—whatever you need to keep your product thriving.</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- FAQ Item 4 -->
      <div class="border border-gray-200 rounded-lg overflow-hidden">
        <button class="faq-toggle w-full flex items-center justify-between px-6 py-4 hover:bg-gray-50 transition-colors text-left font-medium text-gray-900">
          <span>How do you handle communication and updates?</span>
          <svg class="faq-icon w-5 h-5 text-gray-600 transition-transform" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
            <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M19 14l-7 7m0 0l-7-7m7 7V3"></path>
          </svg>
        </button>
        <div class="faq-content hidden px-6 pb-4 text-gray-600 border-t border-gray-200">
          <p>Communication is key! We provide weekly updates, regular demos, and are always available via Slack or email. We use project management tools to keep everything transparent and accessible. You're never in the dark about your project's progress.</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- FAQ Item 5 -->
      <div class="border border-gray-200 rounded-lg overflow-hidden">
        <button class="faq-toggle w-full flex items-center justify-between px-6 py-4 hover:bg-gray-50 transition-colors text-left font-medium text-gray-900">
          <span>What about scalability and performance?</span>
          <svg class="faq-icon w-5 h-5 text-gray-600 transition-transform" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
            <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M19 14l-7 7m0 0l-7-7m7 7V3"></path>
          </svg>
        </button>
        <div class="faq-content hidden px-6 pb-4 text-gray-600 border-t border-gray-200">
          <p>We build with scalability in mind from day one. Our architecture can grow with your business, from thousands to millions of users. We implement caching, optimize databases, and use modern DevOps practices to ensure your app stays fast and reliable.</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- FAQ Item 6 -->
      <div class="border border-gray-200 rounded-lg overflow-hidden">
        <button class="faq-toggle w-full flex items-center justify-between px-6 py-4 hover:bg-gray-50 transition-colors text-left font-medium text-gray-900">
          <span>How much does a project typically cost?</span>
          <svg class="faq-icon w-5 h-5 text-gray-600 transition-transform" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
            <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M19 14l-7 7m0 0l-7-7m7 7V3"></path>
          </svg>
        </button>
        <div class="faq-content hidden px-6 pb-4 text-gray-600 border-t border-gray-200">
          <p>Pricing depends on scope, complexity, and timeline. We offer flexible engagement models: fixed-price projects, time & materials, or dedicated team arrangements. During our discovery call, we'll provide a detailed estimate tailored to your budget and needs.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<script>
  const toggles = document.querySelectorAll('.faq-toggle');

  toggles.forEach((toggle) => {
    toggle.addEventListener('click', () => {
      const content = toggle.nextElementSibling;
      const icon = toggle.querySelector('.faq-icon');

      // Close other open FAQs
      toggles.forEach((otherToggle) => {
        if (otherToggle !== toggle) {
          const otherContent = otherToggle.nextElementSibling;
          const otherIcon = otherToggle.querySelector('.faq-icon');
          otherContent.classList.add('hidden');
          otherIcon.style.transform = 'rotate(0deg)';
        }
      });

      // Toggle current FAQ
      content.classList.toggle('hidden');
      icon.style.transform = content.classList.contains('hidden') ? 'rotate(0deg)' : 'rotate(180deg)';
    });
  });
</script>
